  ~limit: 5
}

docs {
  # Get Latest Statuses
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/dashboard/latest-statuses`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Roles:** admin, dosen, mahasiswa
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Query Parameters)
  
  ```typescript
  interface LatestStatusesQuery {
    page?: number;  // Default: 1
    limit?: number; // Default: 5
  }
  ```
  
  | Param | Type | Required | Default |
  |-------|------|----------|---------|
  | page | number | ❌ | 1 |
  | limit | number | ❌ | 5 |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil status usulan",
    "data": [
      {
        "proposal_id": "uuid",
        "judul": "Pengembangan AI untuk Pertanian",
        "nama_ketua": "Dr. Ahmad Fauzi",
        "peran": "Ketua",
        "status_usulan": "Pending",
        "tipe_usulan": "Penelitian",
        "updatedAt": "2025-01-08T10:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "page": 1,
      "limit": 5,
      "total": 12,
      "totalPages": 3
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Role tidak diizinkan |
}
